=== EPFL and KU Leuven

I previously provided daily supervision for BSc, MSc and PhD semester projects and theses at EPFL, and MSc theses at KU Leuven.

- [https://yhangchen.github.io/ *Yihang Chen*] — EPFL MSc → PhD at UCLA (ICLR'24 Spotlight; ICML'24).
